{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "radio",
  "title": "Radio",
  "group": "Selection",
  "order": 2,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Native radio buttons for exactly one choice out of two to five options that should all be visible. The dot springs in; arrow keys move between options.",
    "id": "Radio button bawaan untuk tepat satu pilihan dari dua sampai lima opsi yang semuanya harus terlihat. Titiknya memantul masuk; tombol panah berpindah antaropsi."
  },
  "titleId": "Radio",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Delivery method",
        "desc": "Click an option or focus the group and use the arrow keys. The dot springs in; the old one shrinks out faster.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Where should we send your results?</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\" checked><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Email<small>siti@campus.ac.id</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Push notification<small>On the phone you signed in with</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Both</span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Answer options in a question",
        "desc": "Exam answers are radios: one answer, all visible, keyboard friendly. A disabled option stays readable.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0; max-width: 520px;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Which number continues the series 2, 6, 12, 20, …?</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">A. 26</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">B. 28</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\" checked><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">C. 30</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\" disabled><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">D. 32</span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Cara pengiriman",
        "desc": "Klik sebuah opsi atau fokuskan kelompoknya lalu pakai tombol panah. Titik memantul masuk; titik lama mengecil keluar lebih cepat.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Ke mana hasilnya dikirim?</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\" checked><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Email<small>siti@contoh.id</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Notifikasi aplikasi<small>Di ponsel yang Anda pakai untuk masuk</small></span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-del\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">Keduanya</span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Opsi jawaban sebuah soal",
        "desc": "Jawaban ujian adalah radio: satu jawaban, semua terlihat, ramah keyboard. Opsi nonaktif tetap terbaca.",
        "html": "<fieldset class=\"stack\" style=\"border: 0; max-width: 520px;\">\n  <legend class=\"field__label\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12px;\">Angka berapa yang melanjutkan deret 2, 6, 12, 20, …?</legend>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">A. 26</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\"><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">B. 28</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\" checked><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">C. 30</span></label>\n  <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rd-q\" disabled><span class=\"radio__dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"check__text\">D. 32</span></label>\n</fieldset>"
      }
    ]
  },
